# Design System Rules

## Typography
- **ALL text content** must use `text-xs` class
- **ALL body text** must use `text-gray-600` color
- **Headings only** use `text-gray-900` color
- No exceptions to font sizes unless explicitly approved

## Colors
- Text: `text-gray-600` (body), `text-gray-900` (headings)
- Borders: `border-gray-200` - use this for ALL borders
- Backgrounds: `bg-white`, `bg-gray-50` (table headers)
- Interactive elements: Use Shadcn theme colors only

## Component Selection
- **Lists**: ALWAYS use `<Table>` component, NEVER cards or grids
- **Forms**: ALWAYS use `<Dialog>` modals, NEVER full-page forms
- **Details View**: ALWAYS use `<Dialog>` modals
- **Buttons**: ALWAYS use `size="sm"` prop

## Layout Principles
- Compact spacing - minimize whitespace
- One feature per page/section
- Avoid crowding with multiple features
- Information-dense but organized

## Example Table Structure
```tsx
<div className="border border-gray-200 rounded-md">
  <Table>
    <TableHeader>
      <TableRow className="bg-gray-50">
        <TableHead className="text-xs text-gray-600">Header</TableHead>
      </TableRow>
    </TableHeader>
    <TableBody>
      <TableRow className="border-gray-200">
        <TableCell className="text-xs text-gray-600">Content</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
    </TableBody>
  </Table>
</div>
```
